    "overview": "<p>Federated Suns infantry benefit from one of the strongest industrial bases in the Inner Sphere, with AFFS quartermasters able to supply platoons with standardized equipment and ammunition from a logistics network that few rival states can match. Towing LB-X autocannon that can fire cluster munitions to spread damage across a wider area, these field gun crews provide flexible direct fire that adapts to both concentrated and dispersed targets.</p>"
